{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And you shall take silver and gold</b> — that they bring a donation to the House of HaShem, and make from them crowns, and place them on the head of Joshua, just as the crown is placed on the head of the king. And so it says, \"and he shall be a priest on his throne.\" Also this is possible: that you are in a prophetic state, also while awake, by the hand of the angel."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:09.251652941Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}